    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96579" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στερ-ητικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>having a negative quality</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.947c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποφατικός</span>
			, <i>expressing privation</i>, i.e. <i>negative</i>, of
