				2.52
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. φωνή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					8.34
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>
			<i>negatively</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>APr.</u>
				26b22
			</span></i>; <i>privatively</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1056a29
			</span></i>.</div>
